			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741961201,
					"content": "呜斯先生…是你吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961202,
					"content": "终于…结束了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961203,
					"content": "看来，我也很快就要消失了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961204,
						741961205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961204,
					"content": "呜斯先生…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741961206,
					"content": "没关系，当行的道路我已经走完了，当尽的职责我也已尽了。从此世上再也没有卡西奥多，也再没有黄金猎人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961207,
					"content": "现世之人，也会继续平凡且幸福地度过每一天吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961208,
					"content": "但是…但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961209,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，还有派蒙，谢谢你们陪我走到这里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961210,
					"content": "我的旅途已经到达了终点…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961211,
					"content": "但是，你们的旅途还没有结束。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961212,
					"content": "为了我，为了王上的愿望，请演奏最后的「安魂曲」吧。让我们所有人的灵魂，重新回归现世，回归大海…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961213,
					"content": "「水若是失了透彻，又如何让它再成水呢？树若是离了土地，又要去到哪里生根呢？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961214,
					"content": "「无论这顽石与金属的重击如何轰鸣，没有了水和土，人类就没办法生存。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961215,
					"content": "或许在未来的某天，我们还会在水土丰饶的地方再次相遇的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡西奥多"
				},
				{
					"id": 741961205,
					"content": "卡西奥多…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741961206
					]
				}
			]
		},
